// Minha Saudade
// Donato/Gilberto  1958

Tempo 160
Keysig C

Groove Metronome2-4
  z * 2

Groove BossaNovaIntro
Swell mp mf 4

1         C
2       Am7
3       Dm7
4        G7

Set Counter 1

Label Sign  /// this is for the DS. We do the piece 3 1/2 times

Repeat
Groove BossaNova
Volume m

5       CM9
6       Dm7
7       Em7
8      A7#5

Groove BossaNova1Sus
Swell f 4

9       Dm9

RepeatEnding

10     G7#5
11      CM9
12        /

RepeatEnd

If > $Counter 3
   Groove BossaNova2End
   Decresc pppp 2
   Chord-Sus Volume pp
Endif

13     G7#5
14      CM9

If > $Counter 3
    Eof
Endif

15        /

Groove BossaNova
Volume m

16      Dm7
17       G7
18      Cm7
19       F7

Groove BossaNova2Sus
Swell mf 4

20     Bbm7
21      Eb7
22     AbM7
23       G7

Inc Counter
Goto Sign
